<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gables started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gables started.</headline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers analyst Steve Hash said he initiated coverage of Gables Residential Trust with an outperform rating and a 12-month price target of $27.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company's long-term internal growth prospects are strong given its high quality properties, its orientation toward high growth regions and its significant management depth in property operation, development and strategic re-development,&quot; Hash said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 24-1/8.</p>
</text>
